    "title": "Savings Onboarding, Term Deposits, ARISE, and Doctors Banking Program",
    "summary": "The text covers savings account onboarding with pre-filled statutory reports, assisted mobile-based UIDAI facial recognition KYC, and a real-time application tracker. It highlights retail term deposit growth through acquisition channels, digital journey revamps including FD booking from outside funds, non-callable FDs online, and FD booking via WhatsApp, with total term deposits up 14% Y-o-Y in fiscal 2025. New product propositions include the ARISE savings account for women—targeting balancers, simplicity seekers, and go-getters—and the Doctors Banking Program for high-income doctors under a holistic 'One Axis' proposition. Premiumization of the deposits franchise remains a key imperative.",
}
